37462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DxxN-JOEkKkQ7kNvwEAB39W&_nc_oc=AdpcBjE0UEa56sZdgJOrAbmHWngJz18MbM-feZ3y2hB45Xb9UgbJZvQgffacRiFShfo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af10ep-WNEnWsc8RXsZCd61Ak0gWTHe-1wMWfAM1sEMXzg&oe=69F21237"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O4AmdKmy-zgQ7kNvwFKspfY&_nc_oc=AdpDrEj_J4uj3jjqu4CumkI-GNIpBMUbKOBd3tcpstQ9cFMxZEKBBgO69RzhzafOmrg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2qakB2HYXSMv0rk8IKXVL1Ll6PW305BTU9k3EpW9qJGQ&oe=69F213CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ib9CdioMHZMQ7kNvwEOc_ks&_nc_oc=AdpXhZN3C3UhKBXKymBFITxHBu-oSo1bZqVRkuHft-eepTT5WQDKKpWjBELGp89rpA4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2ZqTVN0Pg_wnWuWIEv6_rzJzcQXRz93_qWpS4Jox6MFA&oe=69F200EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sL20fD5i30sQ7kNvwGMraQH&_nc_oc=AdpIMqqPMrkj6R9FQAVBp2ZgrJP44eDPuZ1jL-HE4cKEoiETeYBLNU4Je4FzpXEfyIY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2aNd65T5_77mQB0OzuEWite-uzku9qGrYbpIw2o7ypKA&oe=69F1EA43"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tZrAm8hOJ6AQ7kNvwFSettb&_nc_oc=AdrVkJuYV_Y01-jierrio_ICR97BtJ7fAgzRo98dL3AgYSEd-ZUHyyIRpZ0towfivEs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2iX5fzmLREOZwIJY8ooaWtHrjCFqBn05ph58wePUtrCQ&oe=69F21AD8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YmcCTgZM1AEQ7kNvwEix7dQ&_nc_oc=AdqIkPNmAR2Zn3EUujNvoUgnf11esLKwl7-i0O2LRmq1Eh81pLaFl8XES7TndKZ1Yg8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1ILSyZ2JHmuL7iXpNy8rN_KqIP8S7ccnqsQ2cLd-YyGw&oe=69F1F5BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619